              "taskDescription": "<p>Since the typical antipsychotic medications like Haloperidol and Chlorpromazine block all of the dopamine pathways about equally, predict (or recall from the lesson) what will happen as it blocks each of the pathways. Drag each of the pathways to the response elicited in that path when there is a decreased amount of dopamine.&nbsp;</p>\n",
