              "textField": "Decreases positive symptoms like delusions will happen as there is a decrease in dopamine in the *Mesolimbic pathway* \nWorsening of the negative symptoms like loss of emotion and social withdrawal when there is a decrease in dopamine in the *Mesocortical pathway*\nDecreased dopamine in the *Nigrostriatal pathway* results in Parkinsonian symptoms\nSexual dysfunction, milk production and breast development develops as there is decreased dopamine in the *Tuberoinfundibular pathway*"
